ExcludedEpisodesResponse.description:
server.py datasets_excluded_episodes — the episode indices left OUT of
the training subset for one dataset. Empty list when nothing is excluded;
the dataset itself is untouched (curation, not deletion).

JobLogsResponse.description:
server.py get_job_logs / get_job_log_file — both return {"logs": [...]}
of the same LogLine model: the live drained tail for /logs, the whole
persisted log.jsonl for /log-file (JSON, not a file download).

get.description:
Current Hub-side visibility + tags for a dataset, for pre-filling the
post-upload editor. Returns ``{repo_id, private, tags}``. 400 offline;
403/502 on a Hub failure. repo_id is a query param (repo ids contain '/').

